<section image-layout="blank" id="qNxHLiQlEL"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="nbktSbpC8C"><h2>How lục bát moves</h2><freeform-block w="840" h="248"><box type="content" x="0" y="20" w="128"><p role="eyebrow">Six syllables</p></box><box type="content" x="0" y="124" w="128"><p role="eyebrow">Eight syllables</p></box><box type="content" x="145" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">1</p><h4>Trăm</h4></box><box type="content" x="245" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>2 · B</b></p><h4>năm</h4></box><box type="content" x="345" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">3</p><h4>trong</h4></box><box type="content" x="445" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>4 · T</b></p><h4>cõi</h4></box><box type="content" x="545" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">5</p><h4>người</h4></box><box type="content" x="645" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>6 · B</b></p><h4>ta</h4></box><box type="content" x="145" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">1</p><h4>Chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="230" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>2 · B</b></p><h4>tài</h4></box><box type="content" x="315" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">3</p><h4>chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="400" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>4 · T</b></p><h4>mệnh</h4></box><box type="content" x="485" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">5</p><h4>khéo</h4></box><box type="content" x="570" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>6 · B</b></p><h4>là</h4></box><box type="content" x="655" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">7</p><h4>ghét</h4></box><box type="content" x="740" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>8 · B</b></p><h4>nhau</h4></box><shape preset="line" x="607" y="88" w="87" h="2" rotation="-28" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="700" y="78" w="128"><p font-size="12pt"><b>ta–là rhyme</b></p></box><shape preset="line" x="704" y="188" w="98" h="2" rotation="-18" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="548" y="182" w="150"><p font-size="12pt"><b>end rhyme carries forward</b></p></box><box type="content" x="604" y="204" w="214" h="38" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" style="padding: 5pt 9pt; border: 1pt solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3pt;"><p align="center" font-size="14pt"><b>next six-line · syllable 6</b></p></box></freeform-block><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="6X6snwE59F" colspan="30"><h4>Tone-class check</h4><p font-size="16pt">At the marked positions, this couplet reads <b>B–T–B</b> / <b>B–T–B–B</b>. B = bằng; T = trắc.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="aFT74gqgxP" colspan="30"><h4>Rhyme chain</h4><p font-size="16pt"><b>ta</b> rhymes with <b>là</b> at syllable 6; <b>nhau</b> can carry to syllable 6 of the next six-line.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="12pt">Original text: <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn">Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>. English paraphrase cannot demonstrate the original meter.</p></grid-item></grid></section>